<title>ITALY: Italian BTP futures rise to new record high.</title>
<headline>Italian BTP futures rise to new record high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian September BTP LIFFE futures contract hit a new all-time high of 137.27 in early trading on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Meanwhile, the spread between cash 10-year BTPs and Bunds narrowed to a record 88 basis points. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
